    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 1 — Peacekeeper Corps</strong></p><p><strong>“Order is a gift. Stop making us wrap it in barbed wire.”</strong></p><p>Peacekeepers are what you call them when you want them to sound noble. They build ceasefires, enforce boundaries, and take the blame when someone decides ‘peace’ was optional.</p><p><em>You’re learning the shape of your shadow. Expect mistakes. Budget for them.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Tactical:</strong> You gain a skill rank in Insight and Investigation.</li><li><strong>Strategic:</strong> Your faction starts with +1 Non-Lethal OPs.</li></ul>",
